Maintainer: Annalivia Polselli <apolselli.econ@gmail.com>
Description: Estimation of the structural parameter using the double machine learning method for partially linear regression models with fixed effects and endogenous treatment. 'xtivdml' allows the prediction of the nuisance functions with machine learning algorithms from the 'mlr3' ecosystem (Lang et al, 2019) ,10.21105/joss.01903>. 'xtivdml' is built on the CRAN packages `DoubleML' (Bach et al., 2024) <doi:10.18637/jss.v108.i03> and 'xtivdml' (Polselli, 2025) <arxiv.org/abs/2512.15965>. The package implements the methodology developed in Baiardi et al. (2026) ''Double Machine Learning for Static Panel Data with Instrumental Variables: New Method and Applications''.
